        <activityName xml:lang="en">Brass, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Brass, at plant
Stands for brass with 70% Cu and 30% Zn. All data are calculated based on assumptions and theoretical models. Their overall quality is poor.;
UUID: 35204306-4a12-34dc-9938-16add1d942c9
copper and zinc including their melting and casting of brass ingots
Location: Production data relate to the European average. Transports of inputs relate to the consumption in Switzerland
Technology: Assumed energy mix for melting. Abatement of air emissions assumed
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature and internet 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_35204306-4a12-34dc-9938-16add1d942c9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
